            "formula": "$$\\text{Ratio: } L = \\lim_{n\\to\\infty} \\left|\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}\\right| < 1 \\implies \\text{Converges}; \\quad \\text{Alternating: } a_{n+1} \\le a_n \\text{ and } \\lim a_n = 0$$",
