            "examTip": "Found in Circuit Analysis. Double check unit prefixes: $1\\text{ k}\\Omega = 10^3\\;\\Omega$, $1\\text{ mA} = 10^{-3}\\text{ A}$. $1\\text{ V} \\times 1\\text{ mA} = 1\\text{ mW}$.",
