            "formula": "$$h_{\\text{avg}} = 0.943 \\left[ \\frac{g \\rho_L (\\rho_L - \\rho_v) k_L^3 h'_{fg}}{\\mu_L L (T_{\\text{sat}} - T_s)} \\right]^{1/4}$$",
