            "formula": "$$x^* = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^n W_i x_i}{\\sum_{i=1}^n W_i}, \\quad y^* = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^n W_i y_i}{\\sum_{i=1}^n W_i}$$",
