            "title": "Systematic Layout Planning (SLP) Activity Relationship Chart",
            "formula": "$$\\text{Closeness Ratings: } A (\\text{Absolute}), E (\\text{Essential}), I (\\text{Important}), O (\\text{Ordinary}), U (\\text{Unimportant}), X (\\text{Undesirable})$$",
