            "description": "Calculates stoichiometric oxygen mass needed to oxidize organic compound completely to $\\text{CO}_2, \\text{H}_2\\text{O}$, and $\\text{NO}_3^-$; typically, $ThOD \\ge COD > BOD_u > BOD_5$.",
